  "//": "沙箱 Agent 运行体（全局脚本，浏览器执行）构建：tsc -p tsconfig.renderer-sandbox.json（产物写回 teacher-agent-sandbox/js/，路径与引用保持不变）",
  "extends": "./tsconfig.base.json",
